<title>USA: PACE Health signs with Monongalia General.</title>
<headline>PACE Health signs with Monongalia General.</headline>
<dateline>WEST DES MOINES, Iowa 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>PACE Health Management Systems Inc said Tuesday it has signed an agreement to provide its Care Management System to Monongalia General Hospital, a 234-bed institution in Morgantown, W.Va.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
